come_robustness_quote"": """", ""outcome_confident"": true, ""authors"": """", ""year"": """", ""title"": """", ""identified_by"": """", ""evidence_quote"": ""The association of rs4867568 and rs143383 with KOA was successfully replicated in the Chinese Han population."", ""outcome_reasoning"": ""The abstract explicitly identifies successful replication of the GDF5 rs143383 association, but the accessible text does not identify which of several listed GDF5 primary studies is the specific target. Citation fields remain empty rather than selecting by prominence.""}"
