10.1002/pros.21320,b6501b513c44f799,5,10.1038/sj.ejhg.5201959,8q24 and prostate cancer: Association with advanced disease and meta-analysis,"Cheng I, Plummer SJ, Jorgenson E, Liu X, Rybicki BA, Casey G, Witte JS",2008,full_text,,unverified,unresolved,{},"{""authors"": ""Cheng I, Plummer SJ, Jorgenson E, Liu X, Rybicki BA, Casey G, Witte JS"", ""year"": ""2008"", ""title"": ""8q24 and prostate cancer: Association with advanced disease and meta-analysis"", ""doi"": ""10.1038/sj.ejhg.5201959"", ""identified_by"": ""citation"", ""study_numbers"": """", ""replication_study_numbers"": """", ""evidence_quote"": ""Our finding of increased risk of prostate cancer in men carrying the “at risk” A allele of rs16901979 in region 2 of chromosome 8q24 in Tobago men is in agreement with reports of several other investigators in both populations of African 12 , 14 , 15 and European ancestry 12 , 15 . However, Cheng et al. 15 reported a non-significant 37% increased risk of prostate cancer among African American men in King County, Seattle; the lack of association may be due to the small sample size of their study."", ""outcome"": ""mixed"", ""outcome_quote"": ""Our finding of increased risk of prostate cancer in men carrying the “at risk” A allele of rs16901979 in region 2 of chromosome 8q24 in Tobago men is in agreement with reports of several other investigators in both populations of African 12 , 14 , 15 and European ancestry 12 , 15 . However, Cheng et al. 15 reported a non-significant 37% increased risk of prostate cancer among African American men in King County, Seattle; the lack of association may be due to the small sample size of their study."", ""outcome_quote_section"": ""discussion"", ""outcome_computation"": """", ""outcome_computational_quote"": """", ""outcome_robustness"": """", ""outcome_robustness_quote"": """", ""outcome_confident"": false, ""outcome_reasoning"": ""The authors explicitly describe agreement on rs16901979 but also mark the nonsignificant African-Am