, it can be seen that common SNPs are associated with the platelet count regardless of the cohort for Koreans."", ""outcome_quote_section"": ""abstract"", ""outcome_computation"": """", ""outcome_computational_quote"": """", ""outcome_robustness"": """", ""outcome_robustness_quote"": """", ""outcome_confident"": false, ""outcome_reasoning"": ""The authors state genotype-adjusted direction agreement for the catalog comparison set; Table 1 places this source within that set. Overall author verdict governs despite some allele/direction ambiguities in the table.""}"
